      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760124109402,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Logging Framework\n- Supports multiple log levels (INFO, DEBUG, ERROR, WARN, FATAL)\n- Different output destinations (console, file)\n- Filter log messages based on a configurable minimum log level\n- Allow single log message to sent to multiple appenders simultaneously\n- Support asynchronous logging to prevent blocking the main application thread\n- Allow client applications to configure the logger by specifying the log level, formatters and appenders",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Logging Framework\n- Supports multiple log levels (INFO, DEBUG, ERROR, WARN, FATAL)\n- Different output destinations (console, file)\n- Filter log messages based on a configurable minimum log level\n- Allow single log message to sent to multiple appenders simultaneously\n- Support asynchronous logging to prevent blocking the main application thread\n- Allow client applications to configure the logger by specifying the log level, formatters and appenders",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
